  {
   "id": "american-theft-80s-168610@1.1",
   "gameId": "american-theft-80s-168610",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-07-22T12:29:00.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Dear thieves,",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We are proud to finally deliver the new and improved American Theft 80s.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It took us a lot of time but the amount of features added is worth it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New neighborhood",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Let’s start with the biggest part. The rich neighborhood.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gather evidence on corrupted sheriff and mayor. Watch out for the cameras, guards and of course tennants.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New tools",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Don’t worry, you will have some new tools that will help you with new jobs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Simple lockpick",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-hammering handles is cool but sometimes it’s better to use a more stealth approach",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Binoculars",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-just like in our previous game, Thief Simulator, it’s important to mark important parts of the building, cameras and the people. It’s easier to do it from far away",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Glass knife",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-good quiet alternative to a crowbar",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Gate remote tool",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-open almost every gate with a special remote",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Jewelry tools",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "prepare the jewelry at the hideout or a hotel before selling it",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New systems",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "There are some big changes in the game and in the old content.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New level system",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-remade, rebalanced and more interesting",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Security weak spots marking system",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-scope the place before going in, look for opened windows, easy locks and much more",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Intel gathering",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-garbarge bins, letter boxes, you never know what vital information can the tenants leave in those spots",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Preparing loot",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-some of the loot need’s to be prepared before selling, motel room or your home is a perfect place to do this",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Thief / Robber difficulty",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-if you are looking for a harder more stealthy ways to play (like Thief Simulator) the Thief difficulty is for you, prepare to get stunned a lot (it's possible to change the difficulty in the pause menu while playing)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Quick estate info",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-press TAB key anytime to get access to tenant routines and other important stuff without checking the map",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Have fun!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
